  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "13fe1f95d2c5814b",
      "translationZh": "我还是不明白，为什么大多数 MoE LLM 都要独立地路由每个 token。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8b91cab104c08992",
      "translationZh": "显然，目前的总体方案是：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "94cb25a311353058",
      "translationZh": "构建数百个专家。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "81f2e59a9c2a0c64",
      "translationZh": "让每个 token 从所有专家中进行选择。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f26948dfb6f4a2eb",
      "translationZh": "把整个专家动物园都保存在 VRAM 中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cf30ad82ed612ac9",
      "translationZh": "然后对推理需要荒谬数量的 VRAM 感到惊讶。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7f5471ce591c5e81",
      "translationZh": "为什么不按文档/文件选择一个专家池？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "047b7181fa7ef856",
      "translationZh": "小型草稿模型读取前约 100 个 token → 预测相关的专家池 → 将该专家池从 RAM→VRAM 加载进去 → 让它常驻 → 只在该专家池内部进行正常的 token-level routing。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f5930637e07345a0",
      "translationZh": "对于长上下文工作负载，语义域通常不会每隔 12 毫秒就瞬间跳转。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "78ad0f6cf34cc3c1",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/nbvehrfr 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
